WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.660
We as descendants . . . While it is very benevolent to say we are a part of the Georgetown family,

2
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.620
we weren’t enough family to not get sold!

3
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:29.960
You know, while they were very, very concerned about our eternal souls, they really had no problem selling our physical selves.

4
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:38.620
That is a reality of the American chattel system of slavery.

5
00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:50.280
One that we are still grappling with today as a society on the whole, and as individuals as well.
